<style>
    /* ===== Server tab — pds design language (uses --pds-* tokens from .pds-root) =====
       The System-Health checks and the API-key blocks were restructured into
       compact rows in the DOM (pds-health-row / pds-key) and the health + API JS
       was updated to emit matching pds markup (pds-pill, pds-btn) so the design
       survives runtime re-render. The collapsible settings cards and OAuth/email
       sub-tabs keep their Bootstrap data-bs-* mechanics and are restyled in place.
       Every wiring detail (form ids, input ids, onclick handlers, fetch endpoints,
       CSRF-token usage, data-bs-* collapse/tab/modal mechanics, Twig conditionals)
       is preserved. Scoped under .pds-server so nothing leaks to other tabs. */

    .pds-server {
        color: var(--pds-text);
        font-family: var(--pds-font);
    }

    .pds-server .font-monospace,
    .pds-server code {
        font-family: var(--pds-font-mono) !important;
    }

    .pds-server code {
        color: var(--pds-gold);
        background: var(--pds-surface-2);
        border: 1px solid var(--pds-hair);
        border-radius: 4px;
        padding: 1px 6px;
